      "author": "kongweiguang",
      "email": "240524885@qq.com",
      "message": "feat: support Solon executable JAR encryption and distribution\n\nRecognize Solon's default JarLauncher and reuse BOOT-INF encryption and\ndecryption while preserving uncompressed nested dependencies. Add a Solon\nlauncher that retains its archive discovery and decrypts through XJarClassLoader.\n\nAdd archive routing regression tests and opt-in Solon JAR/Windows Go\ndistribution checks. Expand README coverage, usage and verification instructions,\nand document license fallback and the existing expiry-stop timing delay.\n\nValidation: mvn package passes (3 tests); Solon 4.1.0 on JDK 25 passes four\nencryption/restore profiles and nine Windows x64 distribution scenarios.\nObserved expiry-stop delay remains approximately 3.2 seconds; not fixed here.\n"
